 964:Core/Src/ov5640.c **** /**
 965:Core/Src/ov5640.c ****   * @brief  get OV5640 camera PCLK, HREF and VSYNC Polarities
 966:Core/Src/ov5640.c ****   * @param  pObj  pointer to component object
 967:Core/Src/ov5640.c ****   * @param  PclkPolarity Polarity of the PixelClock
